    },
    "Above 30 FPS, scene wallpapers use noticeably more energy and GPU time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高于 30 FPS 时，场景壁纸会明显消耗更多电量和 GPU 时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Above 60 FPS, scene wallpapers use far more energy and GPU time, which can slow down other apps and drain the battery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高于 60 FPS 时，场景壁纸会消耗多得多的电量和 GPU 时间，可能拖慢其他 App 并加快电池耗电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Custom" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自定义"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Library" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "资源库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS cannot find this copy of the app to launch at login. Moving it to the Applications folder usually fixes this." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 找不到此 App 副本，无法在登录时启动。将其移到“应用程序”文件夹通常可以解决此问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My Wallpapers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我的壁纸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Login Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开登录项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preset" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "预设"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset All Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重置所有设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset all settings to their defaults?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要将所有设置恢复为默认值吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show refresh button in library" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在资源库中显示刷新按钮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This resets the playback rules, quality, frame rate, appearance and menu bar settings. Your wallpapers, library and Start with macOS are not affected. This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将重置播放规则、画质、帧率、外观和菜单栏设置。你的壁纸、资源库和“随 macOS 启动”不受影响。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your approval in System Settings → Login Items." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在等待你在“系统设置”→“登录项”中批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpaper Engine's reflection effect on scene layers. Requires Post-Processing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "场景图层上的 Wallpaper Engine 反射效果。需要开启后期处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "×8 MSAA is only recommended for powerful high-end desktop graphics cards." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "建议仅将 x8 MSAA 用于功能强大的高端台式机显卡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
