        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你正在打开一个外部%@壁纸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can easily import video type wallpapers from steam workshop of Wallpaper Engine and modify some properties as well, like playback rate, volume, etc." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可以轻松的从 Wallpaper Engine 的创意工坊中导入视频类型的壁纸，同时设定一些属性，例如播放速率，音量等。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You may feel familar when using this dynamic desktop wallpaper tool since it almost has the same layout to its ancesstor." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在使用时也许会感到非常熟悉，因为它和它的原型的 UI 布局几乎完全一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
