        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发者"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With scripts disabled, every clock, calendar and other scripted layer shows the value saved in the scene instead of running its script. Use it to tell a layer a script changes from one that is drawn wrong. Scene wallpapers reload when either setting changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停用脚本后，时钟、日历等由脚本驱动的图层将显示场景中保存的值，而不运行其脚本。可用于区分由脚本改变的图层和绘制错误的图层。更改任一设置时，场景壁纸会重新加载。"
